  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Step authenticity: start -> (context -> crew, if agent-backed) -> post the result; the API computes the deterministic part. Failure policy 6.15: crew unavailable or invalid output -> post a failure body, the run continues.",
